{
    "background_story": "Andre was a charismatic DJ who rose to fame in the electronic music scene with his unique style, which he dubbed 'Gigo'. The term, a playful combination of 'go' and 'gig', reflected his high-energy performances and infectious beats. Born in a small town in Brazil, Andre grew up surrounded by the rhythms of samba and bossa nova. He began experimenting with music production in his teenage years, eventually creating a distinctive sound that blended traditional Brazilian music with modern electronic elements. As 'Gigo' gained popularity, Andre's sets became the stuff of legend, with fans dancing the night away to his mesmerizing beats. His music transcended borders, spreading joy and energy to every corner of the globe.",
